## Module 6: Reporting & Audit Module

Developed a fully integrated, interactive Reporting & Audit dashboard (Screen ID `7514e431603942a5a46ce2d77719ee58`):

### 1. Interactive Top Filter Panel
- Integrated selectors for **Department**, **Expense Category**, and **Employee** (populated dynamically via the database using `useGetUsersQuery`).
- Added a **Date Range** indicator that dynamically computes calendar ranges based on selected time frames (Last 30 Days, Quarterly, YTD).
- Provided an **Apply Filters** action button which triggers RTK queries to refresh statistics in real-time.

### 2. Backend Stats Aggregation & Dynamic Calculations
- Created a `GET /api/v1/reports/stats` route in [reporting.controller.ts](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/backend/src/modules/reporting/reporting.controller.ts).
- Implemented a reporting stats engine in [reporting.service.ts](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/backend/src/modules/reporting/reporting.service.ts) to compute:
  - Spend aggregated by department (Engineering, Marketing, Sales, Operations, HR, R&D) with max-spend indicators.
  - Compliance rates (Compliant vs Total) and individual violation instances (missing receipts, duplicates, personal items).
  - Expense Category pie charts breakdown.
  - Financial budget metrics (Total budget, Variance, Forecast) scaling in response to active department filters.

### 3. Dynamic Audit Trail & Compilation
- Modified `getAuditLogs()` in [reporting.service.ts](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/backend/src/modules/reporting/reporting.service.ts) to generate log histories dynamically from actual database submission, approval, and rejection events.
- Bound the **On-Demand Report Compiler** allowing users to scope reports (Spend vs Violations) and compile them into download packages.

